        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "These guys... are pretty tough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gaah-! Damn, that shield of yours...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sh-she's the one from the L.G.D...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not too late to put down your weapons and surrender...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unless you want to die in vain right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd expect us to believe you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Liar! Ursus... they've said the same thing before. But they executed those Infected, one by one...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hid beneath the bodies of the slain, holding my breath, in order to survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are no depths to which your kind won't stoop... in order to exterminate us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't you just trying to round us up so you can kill us faster?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. You've made your choice then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not getting through to them, big fella. They won't listen to reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "They can't even distinguish between good and even, Lungmen and Ursus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that place... No, in many places...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only hatred exists between those who are infected and those who are not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems that because of that... all communication has broken down. Even though there's another path in front of our eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1500_skulsr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Another path?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... could we possibly do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what could you accomplish?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skullshatterer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't waste any more time listening to their lies! Skullshatterer, let's get rid of them together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
