    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Skullshatterer! I'll cover you! Just kill them, and the battle will be over!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Skullshatterer...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1500_skulsr",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to go back... with all of you...",
